#: includes/Security/Findings.php:156
msgid "The uploads folder is for images and documents. PHP there is how most hacks keep a way back in."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Security/Findings.php:156
msgid "Delete it unless a plugin you trust put it there on purpose (a few caching and backup plugins do), then change your passwords."
msgstr ""

