#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:61
msgid "Page caching"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:62
msgid "Each page is saved as ready-made HTML and sent to visitors without running WordPress, so it starts arriving in milliseconds instead of a second or more. Signed-in users, carts and checkouts, and pages that change for each visitor are never cached, and pages are cleared when you change them. Turning it on checks your homepage straight away: if it isn’t served from the cache, it’s turned off again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:74
msgid "Show the main image first"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:75
msgid "On posts and pages, the featured image loads straight away with a high priority instead of waiting its turn, so the largest thing on the screen appears sooner. On every page you tested with PageSpeed in Arva SEO, so does the image the test found as the largest thing on the screen, even when a slider or page builder shows it as a background."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:88
msgid "Lazy-load images, videos and maps"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:89
msgid "Images, videos and maps further down the page load only when a visitor scrolls near them. The first few images on a page always load straight away."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:99
msgid "Load styles faster"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:100
msgid "The styles each page needs for its first screen go straight into the page, and your theme’s and plugins’ stylesheets load without holding it up. Arva SEO works them out on its servers once for each type of page, using the page optimizations in your plan. You can also let icon fonts that a theme or widget prints into the page itself (Font Awesome and similar) load once the page has loaded."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:111
msgid "Remove unused CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:112
msgid "Each page gets only the styles it uses, worked out by Arva SEO for each type of page. The full stylesheets load on the visitor’s first scroll, tap, click or key press, so menus, pop-ups and sliders keep their styles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:124
msgid "Defer scripts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:125
msgid "Scripts in the page’s head load in the background and run once the page has been read, instead of holding it up. jQuery isn’t deferred, and consent tools and any scripts you list are left alone. You can also let jQuery move down the page, to just before the first script that may use it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:136
msgid "Add missing image sizes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:137
msgid "Images from your media library that are missing a width and height get them, so the browser keeps room for them and the page stops jumping while it loads."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:149
msgid "Add the mobile viewport tag"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:150
msgid "Adds the tag that tells phones to show the page at their own width. Most themes already have it: turn this on only when PageSpeed says it’s missing."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:161
msgid "Click-to-play videos"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:162
msgid "YouTube videos show a preview picture with a play button, and the player loads when someone presses it. Until then nothing loads from YouTube except the picture."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:174
msgid "Delay chat widgets and trackers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:175
msgid "Chat boxes, heatmaps and social widgets load on the visitor’s first scroll, tap, click or key press instead of while the page loads, so the page is ready to use sooner. Analytics and consent tools are never delayed unless you list them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:188
msgid "DNS prefetch"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:189
msgid "Looks up the addresses of external services you list before the page needs them. Add only services the page actually uses, up to 10 domains. This does not change your DNS records."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:197
msgid "Preconnect"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:198
msgid "Starts connections to the external services you list before their files are needed. Use only important services needed immediately, such as an external font or asset host, up to 4 origins. Too many early connections can slow a page down."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:206
msgid "Minify CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:207
msgid "Serves smaller cached copies of local stylesheets by removing unnecessary spacing and comments. Original files stay intact, relative image and font addresses keep working, and file order stays the same. Already-minified or unsupported files are left alone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:215
msgid "Minify JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:216
msgid "Serves smaller cached copies of supported local classic scripts. Original files, dependencies, inline code and execution order stay intact. External, already-minified, module and other scripts that depend on their original address are left alone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:224
msgid "Combine CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:225
msgid "Combines adjacent compatible local stylesheets into one cached file, preserving their order and image or font addresses. When Critical CSS or Remove unused CSS is enabled, compatible files are combined first, then their optimized styles are generated. Unapproved inline styles and incompatible media rules stay separate. Try it and check your pages; fewer files do not always make a site faster."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:233
msgid "Combine JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:234
msgid "Combines adjacent compatible local classic scripts into one cached file in their existing order. Inline code, asynchronous, module, delayed and unsupported scripts stay separate. Original files stay intact. Try it and check menus, forms and checkout before enabling it for visitors."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:242
msgid "Faster Google Fonts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:243
msgid "Text shows straight away in a similar font while Google Fonts load, and the browser connects to Google’s font servers early."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:255
msgid "Remove unused WordPress extras"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:256
msgid "Switches off the parts of WordPress most sites don’t use, so pages load less. Choose which below."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:268
msgid "Browser caching and compression"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:269
msgid "Visitors’ browsers keep your images, fonts, styles and scripts for a year instead of downloading them on every visit, and pages, styles and scripts are sent compressed. The rules go in your .htaccess file, and your site is checked straight away: if it doesn’t answer normally, they’re taken out again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:283
msgid "New uploads as WebP"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:284
msgid "Images you upload from now on also get smaller WebP copies, which WordPress shows instead. You can convert the images already in your media library too. Your originals always stay as they are."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:297
msgid "Compress images"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:298
msgid "Images you upload from now on are saved smaller: photos lose the hidden camera data and are saved at a quality you can’t tell apart, and PNGs are saved without loss. When this site is connected, Arva SEO’s servers compress them more. You can compress the images already in your media library too, and the originals are kept so you can put them back."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:313
msgid "Minify inline CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:314
msgid "Removes unnecessary spacing from supported style blocks in the page. Their position and attributes stay intact; original theme files are unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:317
msgid "Minify inline JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:318
msgid "Makes supported classic inline scripts smaller in their original tags. JSON data, modules, excluded scripts and unsupported code are left alone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:321
msgid "Combine inline CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:322
msgid "Includes the public static style blocks you approve in adjacent CSS bundles. Turn on Combine CSS too. Critical and used CSS stay separate; changed or unapproved snippets keep their original delivery."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:325
msgid "Combine inline JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:326
msgid "Includes approved public static inline scripts in adjacent synchronous JavaScript bundles. Turn on Combine JavaScript too. Personal configuration, modules and scripts with incompatible timing stay separate."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:329
msgid "Combine external CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:330
msgid "Includes approved public HTTPS stylesheets in CSS bundles once their background download is ready. Turn on Combine CSS too. Until then, or if a resource cannot be safely copied, its original delivery is kept."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:333
msgid "Combine external JavaScript"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:334
msgid "Includes approved public HTTPS classic scripts in compatible JavaScript bundles after background caching. Turn on Combine JavaScript too. Integrity-protected, personalized and unsupported scripts stay at their original addresses."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:337
msgid "Font display: swap"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Speed/Fixes.php:338
msgid "Text uses a fallback font while supported webfonts download. Adds font-display: swap to supported local, inline and generated CSS; approved external CSS is covered when combined. Theme files are unchanged."
msgstr ""

